T2_nB2aubCoZKo2zpZqMYpf6U0PpcvcNLmYcCkUyS4", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "46399059439", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "天宇下风起", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_0e664e8209e04801a6ef285065218c4f.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419590998}, {"comment_id": "7665689764934927153", "create_time": 1784807483, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7664903102088138010", "content": "让我想到了这句话，出生寒微不是耻辱，能屈能伸方为丈夫[赞]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "733", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAXPTv_eaBmxT-_GONfSxEIAXSgoEuQmhm-IGOrEC7MsDNDnp9SGj6lZBlst7kgvBn", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAXPTv_eaBmxT-_GONfSxEIAXSgoEuQmhm-IGOrEC7MsDNDnp9SGj6lZBlst7kgvBn", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "27175929080", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "云枫", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_o4EAymTAWCUA1g9B6gIADiiA7nBmdeAmWf6UaD.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419590998}, {"comment_id": "7665713962793435919", "create_time": 1784813117, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7664903102088138010", "content": "最开始认识南翔的时候我高三，那时候的南翔因为复刻食物语的好多美食，现在食物语没了好几年了，我也大学毕业在读研了，南翔也成为一名优秀的非遗传承博主了，时间真的好快啊[流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "935", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAp_HfceYjVv3ZuDo1cZDo2MIo0b7b3ON6HwQgUidBtBnYd4eonGtgq5wAirsf3lcR", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAp_HfceYjVv3ZuDo1cZDo2MIo0b7b3ON6HwQgUidBtBnYd4eonGtgq5wAirsf3lcR", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "weifengqingy12", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "微风轻飏（已退游）", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oIDevAvB7IPAb8xeHBEAoXGUACeLIJ5yEgQNkh.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419590998}, {"comment_id": "7665722232208278321", "create_time": 17